# ABL DTB chain — reference / ROCKNIX slot order (from reference-boot-partition/KERNEL).
#
# ROCKNIX-ABL picks chain[index] for the stored device model. MaSi used the wrong
# permutation (0=Odin2, 1=Mini, 2=Portal…) — reference uses:
#   1=Portal, 2=Odin2, 3=Mini, 4=Thor, 5–6=RP6
# Slot 0 = other SoC (Odin3) in reference; kept as reference blob for index alignment.
# Slots 7–8 = SM8650 (KONKR Pocket FIT / AYANEO Pocket S2). Wrong SoC for this
# kernel — keep the ROCKNIX reference blobs so ABL indices stay aligned.
# SteamOS-ARM-Handhelds (hashtagbasit) targets that SM8650 family, not ACE/EVO.
# Slots 9–13 = AYANEO SM8550. Use ROCKNIX reference DTBs (same Mini workaround):
# kbuild Armbian/MaSi AYANEO DTS has caused black screen before initramfs.
# Those reference blobs name adsp.mdt; assemble rewrites that to adsp.mbn.
#
# Extract reference blobs once: ./scripts/extract-reference-dtb-chain.sh
#
# SLOT|SOURCE|FILE|DEVICE
0|reference|slot-00.dtb|slot0-ref
1|kbuild|qcs8550-ayn-odin2portal.dtb|portal
2|kbuild|qcs8550-ayn-odin2.dtb|odin2
# Mini: use the reference DTB (known-good panel/BL: xm91080g + odin2miniled).
# Armbian kbuild Mini has caused black screen + no initramfs log for some testers
# while Portal/Odin2/Thor/RP6 on the same MaSi Image boot fine. Revisit kbuild when
# a Mini tester confirms DEBUG_BOOTLOG reaches /boot/masi-boot.log.
3|reference|slot-03.dtb|mini
4|kbuild|qcs8550-ayn-thor.dtb|thor
5|kbuild|qcs8550-retroidpocket-rp6.dtb|rp6
6|kbuild|qcs8550-retroidpocket-rp6-topdpad.dtb|rp6-topdpad
7|reference|slot-07.dtb|slot7-ref
8|reference|slot-08.dtb|slot8-ref
# ACE/DMG/DS/EVO/S 2K: reference DTB (known-good ROCKNIX panel/GPU ZAP path
# qcom/sm8550/a740_zap.mbn). Assemble keeps splash_region on AYANEO models.
# Revisit kbuild when a tester's DEBUG_BOOTLOG reaches /boot/masi-boot.log.
9|reference|slot-09.dtb|ace
10|reference|slot-10.dtb|dmg
11|reference|slot-11.dtb|ds
12|reference|slot-12.dtb|evo
# S 2K reference blob only has avdd-supply. This kernel's R63419 driver
# needs vdd/vddio/vci/vsp/vsn, which the kbuild DTS has.
13|kbuild|qcs8550-ayaneo-pockets1.dtb|s1
